&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven track record of achieving or exceeding individual revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing client relationships, retaining customers and identifying opportunities to grow existing accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence engaging, pitching and negotiating with senior decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial instincts and the ability to identify new revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ambition, resilience and ownership – you take responsibility for your portfolio, performance and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
